#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/blueprint-compiler.xml:90
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of blueprint-compiler"
msgstr "Instalação do blueprint-compiler"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/blueprint-compiler.xml:93
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>blueprint-compiler</application> by running the "
"following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>blueprint-compiler</application> executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/blueprint-compiler.xml:97
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr --buildtype=release .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr --buildtype=release .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/blueprint-compiler.xml:105
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To run the tests issue: <command>ninja test</command>. The tests need to be "
"run in a graphical environment, and you must have <xref linkend=\"gtk4\"/> "
"installed."
msgstr ""
"Para executar os testes, emita: <command>ninja test</command>. Os testes "
"precisam ser executados em um ambiente gráfico e você precisa ter o <xref "
"linkend=\"gtk4\"/> instalado."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/blueprint-compiler.xml:111
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the &root; user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/blueprint-compiler.xml:114
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/blueprint-compiler.xml:119
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/blueprint-compiler.xml:122
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D docs=true</option>: Use this option if you have <xref "
"linkend=\"sphinx\"/> installed and you want to build the documentation."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D docs=true</option>: Use essa opção se você tiver o <xref "
"linkend=\"sphinx\"/> instalado e quiser construir a documentação."

